Homepage: https://github.com/jonluca/Anubis
Description: Subdomain enumeration and information gathering tool
 Anubis is a subdomain enumeration and information gathering tool.
 It collates data from sources including HackerTarget, DNSDumpster,
 VirusTotal, Shodan, and more.
